    "text": "WHY IT LOOKED RIGHT : the hierarchy thesis is the most-quoted takeaway of the 1994–95 JHS cluster, and Olyan's article is that cluster's headline piece — so the cluster's most famous conclusion drifted onto its most famous author. Compressing a multi-author debate into its first mover is the same error pattern as \"Wellhausen said\" shorthand.",
