    "id": "rk_317d705e50d6f112a0ad",
    "text": "Debate-safe formulation: \"The Torah's prohibition ignores women entirely, which tells you its category was male status, not sexuality; the only possible female reference in the entire Bible is one disputed Pauline verse.\"",
