    "id": "rk_9da0874495ab3d431fd2",
    "text": "So the strongest version of the objection is not \"Jeconiah had no children, therefore Matthew is false.\" That is contradicted by the Hebrew Bible itself. The actual issue is narrower: Matthew routes the Davidic claim through a line Jeremiah explicitly says will not again prosper by sitting on David's throne and ruling Judah.",
