    "text": "Scholars propose several overlapping functions for these women: Gentile presence in Israel's story, unusual or socially vulnerable sexual/marital situations, female initiative, reversals of male failure, and literary preparation for Mary's unexpected pregnancy. No single explanation has to carry all four cases.",
