    "text": "Likewise, \"science disproves Matthew\" is too imprecise. Matthew is making a miracle claim, not proposing ordinary human parthenogenesis. The correct methodological point is narrower: ordinary evidence about human reproduction does not independently establish the miracle; accepting divine causation requires an additional theological premise.",
